cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use lumpedmodel in a publication, please cite it as below, together with scikit-rf."
type: software
title: "lumpedmodel: Create lumped models from S-parameters"
abstract: "Python tools that convert S-parameters from RFIC EM simulation or measurement into lumped models for circuit simulation: inductors (narrowband pi model and wideband fit with substrate network, also center-tapped), MIM capacitors, transmission lines (RLGC) and n-port vector fitting."
authors:
  - family-names: "Mühlhaus"
    given-names: "Volker"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/VolkerMuehlhaus/lumpedmodel"
keywords:
  - RFIC
  - S-parameters
  - lumped model
  - equivalent circuit
  - inductor model
  - vector fitting
  - SPICE
# version is the GitHub release tag (each tool also has its own __version__).
# Update both lines with every new release.
version: "1.1"
date-released: 2026-10-12
references:
